SOAPBOX: Sadly due to family commitments, just a part time effort this year. Saturday conditions were amazing but I was QRT between 11:30 and 16:00 UTC. Band still open past 22:00.
SOAPBOX: Sunday was a different story, no opening to JA in the morning unlike Saturday where the JA's were booming in. North America was very patchy on the Sunday so struggled to get a run going to the west. Still some nice openings and the most important thing is that it was great fun! See you all in the CW section (my favorite!!)
